WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.469
In China's central Hunan Province

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:04.537
this month, demonstrators chant,

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:06.840
Give me my money back.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:07.507
One poster

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:09.309
reads, America, Silicon

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:09.909
Valley Bank

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:10.643
customers

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:12.846
got their money back in three days.

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:14.481
But China's Hunan Village

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:15.682
bank's customers

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:18.251
haven't been given a cent in a year.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.453
So what these protesters

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.255
are victims of a banking scandal

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:23.990
that started last April,

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:24.591
when several

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.192
small banks in Honan froze

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:27.627
depositor funds,

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:30.764
impacting an estimated 400,000 customers,

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:33.600
according to a state run magazine.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.903
And crucially, some depositors, myself

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:39.205
included, can no longer survive

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:41.274
because all of our money is stored there.

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.443
Some people may commit suicide.

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.612
Some depositors may hurt others.

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:48.481
Everyone has a tipping point, which

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:49.516
this banking victim

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:50.784
in Beijing is a lawyer

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:52.252
who is gathering depositors

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:54.220
to sue the local authorities.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.588
He says all they want

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:56.890
is their money back,

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:57.724
but instead

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.626
they're being tracked, harassed

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:01.194
or even worse.

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:02.462
While the banks are now open

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:03.363
for business,

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:05.432
an estimated several thousand

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:07.967
still cannot access their money.

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.569
The banks and authorities have ignored

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:11.538
the victim's relentless efforts

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:13.440
to get answers over the past year.

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:14.874
We're not

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:15.408
revealing the

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:16.810
identities of all the victims

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:18.044
who spoke to us in order

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:19.612
to protect their safety.

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:21.347
What's the limit on the issue?

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:23.216
This couple in Shanghai says earlier

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:23.750
this year

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:24.451
the government

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:25.251
hired people

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:26.886
to stake outside of their apartment

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.688
for weeks.

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:28.822
You

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:31.891
know, on March 4th,

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:33.093
right before China's

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.027
biggest annual

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:35.829
political meeting in Beijing,

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:37.831
they say their car was suddenly stopped

00:01:37.831 --> 00:01:39.332
on the streets of Shanghai.

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:40.934
They were driving to meet a relative

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.002
and shot this encounter on a phone.

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:44.871
I want to get in our car.

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:46.906
The man in the brown jacket demands

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:48.741
no, she replies.

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:50.710
So many people have surrounded us.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.011
What are you trying to do?

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:53.446
She asks.

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:55.081
The couple says the men then

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:57.750
threw black cloth bags over their heads

00:01:57.951 --> 00:01:59.452
and drove them to an island

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:01.387
outside of Shanghai.

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:03.389
We were locked up for 11 days.

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:04.757
They illegally detained us

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.126
and confiscated our bank

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:07.861
cards, phones and wallets.

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:09.963
I tried my best to cooperate with them.

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:11.364
Still, they beat me.

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:14.334
He says the authorities were paranoid.

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:15.135
They might travel

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:16.503
to Beijing to demonstrate

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:19.139
during the political meeting.

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:20.707
The banks, regulators

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:21.174
and local

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:22.775
authorities have not responded

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:23.476
to CNN's

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:24.477
multiple attempts

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:25.678
to contact them about this

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:28.114
serious allegation.

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:30.116
Last summer, police violently

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:31.851
crushed peaceful demonstrators,

00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:33.486
demanding their money back.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:34.454
Then, weeks later,

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:35.989
authorities blamed the scandal

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.290
on financial fraud.

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:39.492
Arrested hundreds of alleged suspects

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.761
and promised to start paying depositors

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:42.562
back.

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:43.930
China's media has reported

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:44.731
that the government

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:47.333
has the crisis under control

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:48.635
but has ignored the stories

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:50.570
of these bank victims.

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.272
Meanwhile, pro Communist Party

00:02:52.272 --> 00:02:54.040
social media influencers

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.408
have been zeroing in

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:57.477
on the bank failures in the U.S.

00:02:58.611 --> 00:03:00.780
This one says explosive news.

00:03:00.914 --> 00:03:03.183
The U.S. is facing a catastrophe.

00:03:03.183 --> 00:03:04.083
Another says

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:05.919
it might be the end of the U.S.

00:03:05.919 --> 00:03:07.720
if they fail to handle this well.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.155
Queen and state

00:03:09.155 --> 00:03:10.490
tabloid Global Times

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.992
published this dramatic infographic,

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:14.928
but the US government quickly

00:03:14.928 --> 00:03:16.029
stepped in to pay back

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:17.897
the depositors in full.

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:19.933
Have you received any sympathy,

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:22.101
any response from the authorities?

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:24.270
Male No, I have not.

00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:25.638
The government's attitude

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:27.006
is that as long as they've suppressed

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:28.274
the people with problems,

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:29.442
there's no need to pay back.

00:03:29.442 --> 00:03:30.243
The money

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:31.578
is completely different

00:03:31.578 --> 00:03:33.713
from how Silicon Valley Bank was handled.

00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:36.616
Answer this depositor from Jang Province

00:03:36.616 --> 00:03:38.017
went to the protests last

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:39.886
summer and says he was beaten

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:41.221
by the police

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:42.522
and also wanted to see

00:03:42.522 --> 00:03:43.890
I can't get the money soon.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:44.657
Then my children

00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:46.960
and I can only live on the streets.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.027
Do you have hope that you're going

00:03:48.027 --> 00:03:49.195
to get your money back?

00:03:49.195 --> 00:03:49.529
Woman

00:03:49.529 --> 00:03:50.463
The people like us

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:51.631
have been robbed of money,

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:53.499
yet we are treated like criminals.

00:03:53.499 --> 00:03:55.535
If my money cannot be withdrawn,

00:03:55.535 --> 00:03:57.403
only one option is left for me,

00:03:57.403 --> 00:03:58.371
which is death.

00:03:58.371 --> 00:04:00.573
I go to school back in Beijing.

00:04:00.573 --> 00:04:02.475
The lawyer says his relentless

00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:04.877
legal efforts may be their only hope.

00:04:05.044 --> 00:04:06.746
If you do get the money back,

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:08.281
what is your plan

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:10.149
to leave the country

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:11.751
with kids and parents?

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:13.052
Because I want my children

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:14.587
to grow up in a democratic,

00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:18.124
free and rule of law country.

00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:20.426
Selina This is amazing.

00:04:20.426 --> 00:04:20.827
Great people

00:04:20.827 --> 00:04:21.461
wait a year

00:04:21.461 --> 00:04:22.595
and still can't get their money.

00:04:22.595 --> 00:04:23.463
And, you know, from

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:24.397
from your reporting,

00:04:24.397 --> 00:04:25.198
I understand

00:04:25.198 --> 00:04:26.466
experts think this bank may

00:04:26.466 --> 00:04:28.534
just be the tip of the iceberg.

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:31.771
And how big could this crisis really be?

00:04:34.274 --> 00:04:34.474
Well,

00:04:34.474 --> 00:04:35.041
Aaron, one

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:35.575
professor of

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:36.643
Chinese business told me

00:04:36.643 --> 00:04:37.710
that he estimates

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.146
one third or one quarter of China's

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:41.581
small banks are in trouble.

00:04:41.581 --> 00:04:43.349
But we may not know how this is spreading

00:04:43.349 --> 00:04:44.017
because the government

00:04:44.017 --> 00:04:45.051
is getting better

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:45.852
at covering up

00:04:45.852 --> 00:04:47.854
and preventing these kinds of leaks.

00:04:47.854 --> 00:04:49.522
Now, the root problem here is China's

00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:51.391
slowing economy and ballooning debt.

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:52.692
A lot of these small banks

00:04:52.692 --> 00:04:54.093
relied on financial products

00:04:54.093 --> 00:04:55.862
tied to the real estate sector.

00:04:55.862 --> 00:04:56.763
So when the property

00:04:56.763 --> 00:04:57.864
bubble burst and China's

00:04:57.864 --> 00:05:00.366
economy slowed, well, funds dried up.

00:05:00.533 --> 00:05:01.067
And experts

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:02.268
say what we're seeing is Beijing

00:05:02.268 --> 00:05:03.436
willing to oppress people

00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:05.271
rather than pay the remaining victims

00:05:05.271 --> 00:05:06.472
to tell the banking system

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:07.240
they cannot play

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.374
fast and loose with money.

